# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Clarity Mode — Frontend Environment Variables (Vite)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# For local development, copy this file. For Vercel: set these in Project Settings.
#
# VITE_ prefix is required for Vite to expose them to client-side code.

# ─── API Backend URL ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# In production, this is your deployed backend (e.g., on Railway/Render/Fly.io)
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-backend.railway.app/api

# For local development:
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000/api

# ─── Supabase (Required for auth, database) ───────────────────────────────────
# Get these from: https://supabase.com/dashboard/project/your-project/settings/api
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here

# ─── Site URL (used for auth redirects, OpenRouter referrer) ──────────────────
# VITE_SITE_URL=https://claritymode.com